  <item>
    <title>第74口：抚顺之光林简七如何玩转翻板喜剧？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9d0c55f03e74ee6b05cd5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9d0c55f03e74ee6b05cd5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 06:53:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>偷懒主播突然更新！本期为大家讲解翻板喜剧的前生今世和翻板不可替代的独特优势</span></p><p><span>本期有大量啊啊口癖，请大家谅解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">00:01:25</a> 先聊聊决赛名单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">00:01:55</a> 我如何对步惊云改观</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">00:06:44</a> 曹国的意外之喜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">00:07:46</a> 脱他3的几位遗珠：王大刀 贾耗 童钟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">00:09:58</a> 浅聊喜单前三名</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">00:12:55</a> 正式开聊翻板喜剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">00:15:10</a> 40年前的日式翻板喜剧（フリップ芸/フリップネタ/めくり芸）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">00:16:58</a> 日式翻板的喜剧应用：北野武（ビート　たけし）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiShFe_Rb0v6QFXH5ohQdrsh3cqS.png"><p><span>（收录北野武翻板艺的出版物『たけしメモ』日本テレビ放送網1995）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">00:20:21</a> 当代日式翻板喜剧的应用者: ZAZZY 寺田宽明 non-style石田</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjfuaQRLwjaioe2lBPWCu6w40ur.png"><p><span>（non-style石田表演的翻板艺-来源：bilibili up主“花花大天才”）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">00:21:35</a> 英文翻板喜剧（flip chart）的源头 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsA8dF812ATg4M7w1WPP2vc2rs46.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">00:22:59</a> 英文翻板喜剧的早期形式之一：Gallagher </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4B1kpkwtAqMAvpnYLN2ymoI-YV.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">00:26:37</a> 林简七的灵感之光（猜测版）：Demetri Martin </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnxsra5uagI8NZdnV7QC-TOpgCv8.png"><p><span>（Demetri Martin的翻板，专长：THINK TOO MUCH，来源：bilibili up主“小猫咪字幕组”）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">00:31:59</a> 林简七的翻板喜剧为何青出于蓝？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">00:32:42</a> 核心问题：翻板和ppt的区别在哪里？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">00:32:52</a> 区别①：ppt与职场的强语境关联（代表：KID，Don McMillan）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3Ri9YbXXJ_AdYTxEhpjQWvpVgI.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">00:34:59</a> 区别②：ppt更擅长呈现真实图片，以凸显现实本身的荒诞性（代表：Ricky Gervais, Greg Davies。口误订正：后者也是英国人）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgl8UvkbDBIkRlS3FmMY7J99yTkN.png"><p><span>(Ricky Gervais在专长SCIENCE中引用的真实诺亚方舟绘本插图） </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">00:38:10</a> 区别③：纸板的三维互动性：拼接、折叠、活动，以产生预期违背</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">00:39:35</a> 英文翻板喜剧的终极形态：Bec Hill</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrlWljEi22-w2ByjImrLgdDlhOp-.png"><p><span>（Bec Hill的翻板喜剧）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2671">00:44:31</a> 看图说话在民间艺术中的呈现：拉洋片和紙芝居</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulH7qwiuT8UQg3ubEI3T7ibNILa.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhbGa2Fd1U4MaAowLlKK2BTuAMxP.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">00:48:40</a> 一千三百年前的看图说话艺术：变文</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_jkZUczDhuKO0YniaK2pFpbxPJ.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkuULhvAZe2a6yPbPdysTKU_asCO.png"><p><span>（P.4524《降魔变图卷》及纸背《降魔变文》）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">00:51:25</a> 信息来源声明</span></p><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><p><span>维基百科：めくりゲイ<a data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%81%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8A%E8%8A%B8" href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%81%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8A%E8%8A%B8">ja.wikipedia.org</a>  </span></p><p><span>维基百科：flip chart</span></p><p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flip_chart#:~:text=A%20flip%20chart%20is%20a%20stationery%20item%20consisting,or%20supported%20on%20a%20tripod%20or%20four-legged%20easel." data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flip_chart#:~:text=A%20flip%20chart%20is%20a%20stationery%20item%20consisting,or%20supported%20on%20a%20tripod%20or%20four-legged%20easel."><span>en.wikipedia.org.</span></a></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>    </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>       </span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/651a66a2e725b4b18a2a22bc/lv-8swpUEUkTiZ0iqdBFnY6pmizL.m4a" length="52902314" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2HImQVsH7ydSzfK8KTeNzSjf3q.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第73口：我将全职在家品鉴线上脱口秀！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4a906b2e335a35a80e8207</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4a906b2e335a35a80e8207</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 17:22:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>装死主播堂堂复更！辣评《脱口秀与他的朋友们》3和《喜剧之王单口季》3</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">00:01:13</a> 先谈谈两个节目的不同风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">00:07:30</a> 从小奇的中专学历开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">00:08:30</a> 被童钟的地下帝国震慑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">00:13:08</a> 别再区分“文本型”和“表演性”：谈谈丹妮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">00:14:30</a> 又骂大国手：请演员训练自己的嘴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">00:17:50</a> 粽子才是真的好“文本型”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">00:22:11</a> HOW的表演是单口喜剧学习者的范本</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">00:29:00</a> 短评：小高寒 史妍 李梦杰 小五</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">00:33:07</a> 小块就是中国的Louis CK！如何让观众犯错</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">00:38:00</a> 音乐喜剧重回舞台：徐不气、封馨童 吉他型号大分析（有可能认错版）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">00:46:50</a> 短评王大刀，感谢怪小孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">00:47:30</a> 短评杨鑫姐子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">00:48:30</a> 赞美翟佳宁！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">00:50:20</a> 赞美东北喜剧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">00:52:08</a> 赞美林简七！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">00:53:40</a> 赞美多多！当代赵伟洲的犯狗喜剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">00:58:30</a> 给多子宣挽个尊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">01:01:10</a> 贤鱼脱口秀！脱口秀贤鱼！我爸妈离过婚！工商银行！衡水二中！我和我表弟亲过嘴！时光时光慢些吧！    </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3860">01:04:20</a> 借着普拉斯聊聊互动脱口秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">01:08:30</a> 推荐一个互动秀：沈清《清道夫》，请大家走个面儿咱就有了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">01:13:00</a> 最后表达一下对吴鼎老师的爱 </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>  </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>   </span></p>]]></description>
