  <item>
    <title>第70口：速评喜人奇妙夜2！《四个大人》的历史巧合</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69249ed54c49bc580f6e0ee0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69249ed54c49bc580f6e0ee0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 19:08:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 从幞头说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 大夸特夸刘三瞳老师与企鹅老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 历史和架空之间：高速的土豆何时进入中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 历史和架空之间：王建华的叔叔到底是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 广阳郡王童贯罪恶又传奇的一生（王天放友情出演）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 神马~广阳郡王居然死于张呈（澂）张大人之手！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 蛤蟆皇帝上台吹的到底是个什么玩意？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 宋代公服颜色差异代表了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 简单说两句宋代官制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a> 如果狗官王建华是酷滕的外甥呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> 宋代有没有免死金牌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 陪看开始</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考文献：</span></p><span></span><p><span>任石《宋代文官的冠服等級——兼談公服制度中侍從身份的凸顯》，《文史》2019年第4期；</span></p><span></span><p><span>顾宏义《五代至宋——“丹书铁券”是如何从免死金牌变成儿戏的？》，澎湃新闻；</span></p><span></span><p><span>龚延明《宋代官制辞典》，中华书局2017年版。</span></p>]]></description>
