    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊了喜人奇妙夜2外形从组合的《冷不丁梆梆就两拳》</span></p><span></span><p><span>并歪曲解释了存在主义、禅宗棒喝、呵佛骂祖以及周星驰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 张兴朝为什么是一个存在主义者？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 土豆与张兴朝的创作观念差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 存在主义还是本质主义：王金宝与张八旦的角色解读 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 老和尚回归！为什么要棒喝？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 梆梆两拳比无敌风火轮高级在哪？邢捕头才是武林宗师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 为什么呵佛骂祖，为什么叫混球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> 为什么王金宝和李混球都没学会梆梆两拳？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 臭狗、痴狗、吃X狗和咬人狗：子湖利踪一只狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 云门文偃的黄汤文学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 再看一遍，梆梆就两拳！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
