    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>激情主播偷摸更新！本期针对胖达人3（土豆吕严）的《吐槽吧！吕小严》讨论了漫才中装傻吐槽角色互换的表演方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 大众文学的程式化 一喜VS喜一：精英趣味和大众趣味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 先夸黑色喜剧《旧矿工故事》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 《兴帮往事》角色色彩的区别化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 怒夸《旧矿工》的编剧企鹅老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a>《兴帮往事》片头的压力释放与权力倒转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a>《生化稍后危机》中年僵尸故事的日常感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> &nbsp;《课间十分钟》夸夸周铁男的旷世神颜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 《棒棒小卖部》，不如学学《卖拐》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 《吐槽吧！吕小严》就是胖达人的《台下十年功》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> &nbsp;逆转漫才：吐槽与装傻的身份互换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a> 土豆吕严原来演的是《论捧逗》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 漫才推奨：霜降明星 non-style ナイツ 和牛 ぺこぱ 笑い飯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">47:42</a> 胖达人节目的先锋之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 评论音轨&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
