    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期速评《空城计》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 补充几句张兴潮、李嘉诚《技能五子棋》：并非耍宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 传统小品与日式短剧吐槽受力的技巧差别：怪人是否需要解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 主角为普通人的喜剧不能变成现实主义正剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 小人物的喜剧需要明确的欲望，再求而不得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 开始拉片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 表演不能光靠台词，那得有行动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 三国历史小课堂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 笤帚写字儿为啥没响？吐槽晚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 爆夸杨冬麒老师！！给他真人秀！给他！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 爆梗game点大赠送：35岁生日吹蜡烛就说爹话</span></p>]]></description>
