    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播复活蹭热度更新！本期聊了喜剧中的混蛋和帅哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 中文单口喜剧中的混蛋在哪里？Anthony Jeselnik, Bill Burr, Jimmy Carr</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 为什么郭麒麟让房主任“学坏”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 请翟佳宁一定要继续“混蛋”下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 如何在单口喜剧舞台上塑造“老师”的角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 《不合适也要有个限度》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 帅哥排行开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> KID（塌房版），累觉不爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 孙书恒，爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 胡豆豆，爱爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 张骏，画了眉毛可以爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 孟川，浅爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 老高寒， 差不多爱爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 毛冬！真帅哥出击！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a> 江梓浩（重新出发版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 穷小疯，永远的神！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 王俊霖，就是 硬帅！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 贤鱼怎么样！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 冷门帅哥出击：同焱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> 史炎老师怎么就不可以呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">43:50</a> 给我们蒋龙老师拉拉票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2778">46:18</a> 为什么没有小北呢？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
