  <item>
    <title>第61口：罕王·老虎妈子·山炮：东北民间故事与幽默</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a3679642cc2798e73994ce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a3679642cc2798e73994ce</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Aug 2025 17:55:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天主播为大家准备了一些东北民间神话、传说、恐怖故事和小幽默，希望大家喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 鸡冠子蛇到底是个啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 东北女娲摸鱼补天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 东北仓颉媳妇造字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> 东北彩虹盘古激情造人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 东北神农的快乐小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1859">30:59</a> 经典民间拆字故事：圣贤愁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a> 满族历史传说：罕王出世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3486">58:06</a> 东北恐怖故事：老虎妈子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">81:00</a> 东北笑话三则：忘事儿老蒯 扔死孩子 小样儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考文献：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中国民间故事集成·辽宁卷》1994年版</span></p><span></span><p><span>张杰贵，景殿龙主编《本溪满族民间故事 幻想故事卷》，民族出版社 2010年版</span></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.atcy.cn/html/2016/ly_1019/12003.html" data-url="http://www.atcy.cn/html/2016/ly_1019/12003.html"><span>【民间传说】老虎妈子（王玉华）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>bgm:</span></p><span></span><p><span>瑞鸣中国音乐地图 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iKk9YoE13/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;p=6&amp;vd_source=a45c96dbef9421808e9790ed0b499674" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iKk9YoE13/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;p=6&amp;vd_source=a45c96dbef9421808e9790ed0b499674"><span>东北大秧歌Northeastern Yangge Dance_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>孙三通 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15j411X71V/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;vd_source=a45c96dbef9421808e9790ed0b499674" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15j411X71V/?spm_id_from=333.1391.0.0&amp;vd_source=a45c96dbef9421808e9790ed0b499674"><span>神调，更适合东北宝宝的说唱艺术_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</span></a></p>]]></description>
